WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.832 --> 00:00:04.293
- [Narrator] Today's
journey takes us to the

00:00:04.293 --> 00:00:05.413
Dutch town of Giethoorn.

00:00:05.413 --> 00:00:08.169
Giethoorn is just like any normal town.

00:00:08.169 --> 00:00:10.336
With one exception, roads.

00:00:11.629 --> 00:00:13.699
They don't have them.

00:00:13.699 --> 00:00:16.282
(upbeat music)

00:00:43.451 --> 00:00:46.618
- [Narrator] And boats, lots of boats.

00:00:52.622 --> 00:00:54.315
- [Narrator] That's Jan,
one of the town's resident

00:00:54.315 --> 00:00:56.043
boat builders.

00:00:56.043 --> 00:00:58.053
He's known for punters, a flat bottom boat

00:00:58.053 --> 00:01:00.470
that originated in Giethoorn.

00:01:05.163 --> 00:01:07.827
- [Narrator] And where there
are boats, there are bridges.

00:01:07.827 --> 00:01:09.160
167 to be exact.

00:01:10.117 --> 00:01:11.866
And just like any town,
people need their groceries,

00:01:11.866 --> 00:01:14.765
their furniture, their beer, you name it.

00:01:14.765 --> 00:01:16.816
But in Giethoorn, they
must pass through Anton.

00:01:16.816 --> 00:01:19.233
He's the town's bridge guard.

00:01:30.565 --> 00:01:33.066
- [Narrator] One of those
boats is the fire boat.

00:01:33.066 --> 00:01:34.899
This is Bart and Erik.

00:01:53.512 --> 00:01:54.452
- [Narrator] And this is Jan.

00:01:54.452 --> 00:01:56.253
He's in charge of
maintaining the natural lands

00:01:56.253 --> 00:01:57.670
around Giethoorn.

00:02:15.234 --> 00:02:16.414
- [Narrator] So, there you have it.

00:02:16.414 --> 00:02:17.524
The residents of Giethoorn prove

00:02:17.524 --> 00:02:19.034
that a life without asphalt, traffic

00:02:19.034 --> 00:02:21.885
and trips to the DMV can
be pretty damn great.

00:02:21.885 --> 00:02:24.085
Roads, who needs 'em?

00:02:24.085 --> 00:02:25.252
Bye, Giethoorn.

